    <bpmn:process id="W_W1868" name="W1868. Multi-Entity Rent Settlement &amp; Intercompany Billing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly rent payment cycle; intercompany settlement per IC agreement
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~205 leases paid by BuildRight Property Management, Inc.; recharged to BuildRight Depot, Inc.
Owner: Finance
Participants: Finance (Property Management entity), Finance (Depot entity), Lease Administrator
Source: workflow W1868 — Multi-Entity Rent Settlement &amp; Intercompany Billing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1868_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1868_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1868_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1868_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1868_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1868_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1868_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1868_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1868_Start3" name="Monthly rent payment cycle; intercompany settlement per IC agreement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1868_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1868_Task4" name="BuildRight Property Management, Inc. pays rent to landlords per W1862: (a) all…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: BuildRight Property Management, Inc. pays rent to landlords per W1862: (a) all lease payments flow through Property Management entity&#x27;s bank accounts, (b) Property Management entity records rent expense and cash outflow
Responsible (R): Finance (Property Mgmt)
Accountable (A): CFO (Property Mgmt)
Duration: Per W1862</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1868_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1868_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1868_Task5" name="Monthly: Finance generates intercompany rent recharge invoice: (a) total rent…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Monthly: Finance generates intercompany rent recharge invoice: (a) total rent paid by Property Management entity on behalf of Depot entity: base rent + CAM + percentage rent + other lease costs, (b) apply management fee markup per intercompany agreement (if applicable — arm&#x27;s-length transfer pricing per W235), (c) generate IC invoice from Property Management to Depot, (d) Depot records IC rent expense; Property Management records IC revenue
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 1 day/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1868_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1868_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1868_Task6" name="IC settlement: (a) Property Management and Depot net IC balances monthly per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: IC settlement: (a) Property Management and Depot net IC balances monthly per W14 (IC settlement), (b) any markup charged by Property Management is eliminated in consolidation per W9A (month-end close), (c) consolidated financial statements reflect actual rent expense without intercompany margin
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per W14 + W9A</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1868_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1868_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1868_Task7" name="Quarterly: Finance reviews IC rent recharge pricing: (a) ensure transfer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quarterly: Finance reviews IC rent recharge pricing: (a) ensure transfer pricing methodology is documented and defensible per W235, (b) verify markup (if any) is at arm&#x27;s length and consistent with transfer pricing policy, (c) adjust if BIR audit risk identified
Responsible (R): Finance / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1868_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1868_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1868_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1868_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
