        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-368 (ensure controlled execution — Rent Payment, Escalation &amp; CAM Reconciliation (PA-42.2).) | - operational: Finance review and approval gate
Owner: Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
