    <bpmn:process id="W_W1869" name="W1869. Landlord Invoice Verification &amp; Payment Exception Handling" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Landlord invoice received with amount different from expected rent schedule
Frequency: ~20–30 invoice exceptions/month
Volume: Exceptions include: unauthorized charges, incorrect escalation amounts, duplicate billing, late fees
Owner: AP Clerk
Participants: AP Clerk, Lease Administrator, COO, Legal Counsel
Source: workflow W1869 — Landlord Invoice Verification &amp; Payment Exception Handling</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1869_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1869_Lane1" name="AP Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1869_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1869_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1869_Lane2" name="Lease Administrator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1869_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1869_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1869_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1869_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1869_Start4" name="Landlord invoice received with amount different from expected rent schedule">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1869_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1869_Task5" name="AP Clerk identifies invoice exception during rent payment processing: (a) total…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AP Clerk identifies invoice exception during rent payment processing: (a) total amount exceeds expected rent schedule by &gt; PHP 1,000 or 2%, (b) new charge line items not in previous months, (c) duplicate invoice for same period, (d) late fee or penalty charge
Responsible (R): AP Clerk
Accountable (A): Lease Administrator
Duration: 5 min/exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1869_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1869_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1869_Task6" name="Lease Administrator investigates exception: (a) compare invoice to lease…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Lease Administrator investigates exception: (a) compare invoice to lease agreement: is the charge authorized?, (b) common unauthorized charges: (i) capital improvement levy, (ii) marketing fund contribution, (iii) property insurance premium increase without notice, (iv) late fee for previously disputed charges, (c) if charge is authorized per lease: approve for payment, (d) if charge is unauthorized: dispute per step 3
Responsible (R): Lease Administrator
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 15–30 min/exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1869_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1869_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1869_Task7" name="Dispute resolution: (a) Lease Administrator sends written dispute to landlord…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Dispute resolution: (a) Lease Administrator sends written dispute to landlord referencing specific lease clause that does not authorize the charge, (b) pay only undisputed portion of invoice on time (avoid late fees on undisputed rent), (c) if landlord insists on payment: escalate to COO for negotiation, (d) Legal Counsel involved if landlord threatens lease default over disputed charges
Responsible (R): Lease Administrator / Legal
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1–2 hours/dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1869_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1869_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1869_Task8" name="Monthly: Lease Administrator reports exception and dispute summary to COO: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Monthly: Lease Administrator reports exception and dispute summary to COO: (a) exception frequency by landlord, (b) total disputed amount, (c) resolution rate and average resolution time, (d) chronic offenders flagged for lease renegotiation consideration
Responsible (R): Lease Administrator
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 hour/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1869_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1869_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1869_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1869_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1869_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-368 (ensure controlled execution — Rent Payment, Escalation &amp; CAM Reconciliation (PA-42.2).) | - operational: AP Clerk review and approval gate
Owner: AP Clerk</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
